# Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the build at BUILD time, not
# runtime — changing this after `npm run build` / a Docker image build
# has no effect until you rebuild.
#
# Relative path (default): the app calls same-origin /api/v1. This is
# correct for `npm run dev` (vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://localhost:3000) and for the production Docker image (nginx.conf
# reverse-proxies /api to the backend container).
# Only set this to an absolute URL (e.g. https://api.example.com/api/v1)
# if the frontend and backend are deployed on different origins.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
